{"id":"574b0b43d52660b1","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-arith-random-char.md","title":"算术随机性的有限跳跃刻画","display":"thm-arith-random-char — 算术随机性的有限跳跃刻画","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-arith-random-char","aliases":["43-thm-arith-random-char"],"display":"thm-arith-random-char — 算术随机性的有限跳跃刻画","depends_on":["[[43-df-arith-random]]","[[43-df-nrandom]]","[[43-df-rel-mlrandom]]","[[43-df-jump]]","[[43-df-mlrandom]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"本次笔记内推导；未作为原书定理编号核验","source_scope":"local-supplement","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-arith-random-char"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-arith-random-char</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-arith-random-char — 算术随机性的有限跳跃刻画"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ee571dca34fde189\" href=\"?note=ee571dca34fde189\" title=\"43-df-arith-random\">43-df-arith-random</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"86bdc33f83ee57a9\" href=\"?note=86bdc33f83ee57a9\" title=\"43-df-nrandom\">43-df-nrandom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"75e7e3b6eeecc95e\" href=\"?note=75e7e3b6eeecc95e\" title=\"43-df-rel-mlrandom\">43-df-rel-mlrandom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" href=\"?note=b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" title=\"43-df-jump\">43-df-jump</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0586e0fd0301d605\" href=\"?note=0586e0fd0301d605\" title=\"43-df-mlrandom\">43-df-mlrandom</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"本次笔记内推导；未作为原书定理编号核验"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"local-supplement"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>；各定义见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ee571dca34fde189\" href=\"?note=ee571dca34fde189\" title=\"43-df-arith-random\">43-df-arith-random</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"86bdc33f83ee57a9\" href=\"?note=86bdc33f83ee57a9\" title=\"43-df-nrandom\">43-df-nrandom</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"75e7e3b6eeecc95e\" href=\"?note=75e7e3b6eeecc95e\" title=\"43-df-rel-mlrandom\">43-df-rel-mlrandom</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" href=\"?note=b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" title=\"43-df-jump\">43-df-jump</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ArithRandom}\">\\(\\mathrm{ArithRandom}\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^\\omega\">\\(2^\\omega\\)</span> 上的布尔谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"ee571dca34fde189\" href=\"?note=ee571dca34fde189\" title=\"43-df-arith-random\">43-df-arith-random</a>。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MLRandom}\">\\(\\mathrm{MLRandom}\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^\\omega\">\\(2^\\omega\\)</span> 上的布尔谓词；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MLRandom}^{B}\">\\(\\mathrm{MLRandom}^{B}\\)</span> 是以集合预言机 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span> 为参数的同域谓词族，相对形式见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"75e7e3b6eeecc95e\" href=\"?note=75e7e3b6eeecc95e\" title=\"43-df-rel-mlrandom\">43-df-rel-mlrandom</a>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"0586e0fd0301d605\" href=\"?note=0586e0fd0301d605\" title=\"43-df-mlrandom\">43-df-mlrandom</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ArithRandom}(X)\\iff\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\mathrm{MLRandom}^{\\varnothing^{(n)}}(X).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ArithRandom}(X)\\iff\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\mathrm{MLRandom}^{\\varnothing^{(n)}}(X).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>将n随机性定义中的正整数n重新编号为n+1。</p>\n<p>来源：本次笔记内推导；未作为原书定理编号核验。书内定位仅适用用户提供的2007-07-28草稿；本地补充另行注明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-arith-random","status":"resolved","id":"ee571dca34fde189","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-arith-random]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-nrandom","status":"resolved","id":"86bdc33f83ee57a9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-nrandom]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-rel-mlrandom","status":"resolved","id":"75e7e3b6eeecc95e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-rel-mlrandom]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-jump","status":"resolved","id":"b3936ae4c5d2dc79","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-jump]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-mlrandom","status":"resolved","id":"0586e0fd0301d605","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-mlrandom]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-arith-random","status":"resolved","id":"ee571dca34fde189","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $X\\in2^\\omega$；各定义见 [[43-df-arith-random]]、[[43-df-nrandom]]、[[43-df-rel-mlrandom]]、[[4